# v2.9.2 - 2026-10-01

## Highlights:
- Improvements to performance and memory usage for large datasets and complex analyses.
- Enhanced remote workflow capabilities, including file transfer and job execution.
- Refinements to the user interface for smoother interaction and clearer progress reporting.

## New features:
- Added diagnostics widget for monitoring simulations and analysis processes.
- Introduced custom behaviors for DirectoryNodes, allowing for more flexible node management.

## Improvements:
- Optimized pore network extraction and analysis for speed and memory efficiency.
- Improved handling of null values in data processing.
- Enhanced progress reporting for long-running operations, including per-image logs and a whole-queue bar.
- Streamlined the application of trained models to multiple images.
- Improved the interface for annotation controls and cancel operations.
- Optimized memory usage for bounding box calculations and NetCDF exports.
- Enhanced the display of segmentations to respect opacity changes.
- Improved import functionality for SIRR format and Krel data.
- Increased the range of maximum values for masks to accommodate a wider variety of data.
- Adjusted the behavior of slice processing for better accuracy and speed.
- Updated submodules for py_pore_flow and pyflowsolver.
- Improved the ability to collect more data during the collect process.

## Bug fixes:
- Resolved issues with custom behaviors not being applied to nodes with non-unique names.
- Fixed diagnostics widgets not being saved correctly when files are in use.
- Addressed issues with DirectoryNode not being cloned correctly and losing track of directories when projects are moved or renamed.
- Corrected the placement of cropped volumes in the hierarchy and resolved test renaming issues.
- Fixed BIAEP fetching when a well has only a single image.
- Resolved issues with stretching and size policies of KrelEDA filters combobox.
- Fixed KrelEda to skip non-numeric parameters in error correlation.
- Addressed issues with the pore network extractor handler.
- Corrected mask selector for ExpandSegments.
- Fixed Boundary Removal false reference changes.
